#    $0B5B) holding Aladdin since frame 1908: V_1427 ($1427) poked to 0,
#    so the next frame of the hold clears GRAB_HELD ($83:C7C2).
# 2. Stage a2 s0 with the camera and Aladdin placed at x $0600 (as in
